# StatusSeesOwnTenantOnly: a status read looks the operation up under the caller's tenant.
MODULE: SchemaTenantScope
ROW: StatusSeesOwnTenantOnly
FILE: src/lattice.api.schema/LatticeSchemaControl.Operations.cs
DETECTORS: LatticeSchemaOperationsIntegrationTests.An_operation_in_another_tenant_or_over_unreadable_trees_is_not_found
SUMMARY: a status read looks the operation up under the default tenant

--- FIND
        var record = await operations.Runner.GetAsync(tenantId, operationId).ConfigureAwait(false);
        return record is not null && await IsVisibleAsync(record, cancellationToken).ConfigureAwait(false)
--- REPLACE
        var record = await operations.Runner.GetAsync(TenantId.Default.Value!, operationId).ConfigureAwait(false);
        return record is not null && await IsVisibleAsync(record, cancellationToken).ConfigureAwait(false)
--- END
